{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_025roc0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_025roc0294_1003_025roc", "source_sha256": "d27c7ee4d75848286405fb6c3d81332a0a2d27c899da186bd4967db78676bda7", "ja": "サンクスです♪　{$P$}、\nロコはこの衣装をみて閃きました！", "zh": "谢谢♪ {$P$}，ROCO一看到这套服装就灵光一闪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_025roc0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_025roc0294_1004_025roc", "source_sha256": "a475c5d9e048485f3d3247d4f2db8ae12221e0635b659416b2ce388c16173795", "ja": "ロコ自身もチョコナイズしてみてはどうかと！\nクルッと回ると……どうですか？", "zh": "ROCO也要不要把自己巧克力化一下呢！  \n转个圈……怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_025roc0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_025roc0294_1005_p", "source_sha256": "de75662f0ce7817a04f930495ae1f6415d6f8e4b16d9e0b5d2549aa7c1c94b99", "ja": "チョコナイズって……んっ？\nなんだか甘い匂いがしてきたような？", "zh": "把自己巧克力化……嗯？\n好像闻到甜甜的香味了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_025roc0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_025roc0294_1006_025roc", "source_sha256": "eeaf651b488b2dc061a45f496a87bd644ce8f608e8697e2dca2659f2b7d35251", "ja": "はい！　チョコのフレグランスです！\nカレンにティーチングしてもらったんですよ。", "zh": "是的！这是巧克力香氛！是卡莲教我的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_025roc0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_025roc0294_1007_p", "source_sha256": "2d7441d45270c7007e0b6f2644475e7a233b36c62b74699f71aa6ad1fe17d912", "ja": "それでチョコナイズか。\nへえ～。美味しそうな匂いだな。", "zh": "原来如此，是巧克力香氛啊。\n哦～闻起来真香。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_025roc0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_025roc0294_1008_025roc", "source_sha256": "bbdb056fcc417ad80ed7f1005c3b6027898095183ff538fec9a6735bed41f411", "ja": "！！　ふむふむ……{$P$}は、\nこういうチョコがフェイバリットなんですね……。", "zh": "！！嗯嗯……原来{$P$}最喜欢这种巧克力啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_025roc0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_025roc0294_1009_p", "source_sha256": "3184421a4dc60e14b6b5beb970d458f5f4949453d54da2bd26492b7ae3d2fca6", "ja": "うん？　どうかしたか？", "zh": "嗯？怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_025roc0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_025roc0294_1010_025roc", "source_sha256": "a8449c56467a08c3175877bcedb6547820eff9dd94790b54890534fa50a1f919", "ja": "い、いえ。なんでもありません！\nアートにマストなリサーチを……え、えへへっ。", "zh": "没、没什么。什么事都没有！\n只是在做艺术上必不可少的调研……诶、嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_025roc0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_025roc0294_1011_p", "source_sha256": "b732f6dec5c7a85dd311a57d4c19276da9421e735dcae8f54937b517cf6b848f", "ja": "なるほど。\n衣装に合わせて、ロコも色々考えてくれたんだな。", "zh": "原来如此。\n还配合服装，为ROCO考虑了各种方案啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_025roc0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_025roc0294_1012_025roc", "source_sha256": "845bc12875edfa23a50d3988e20a8503aeb2c00fcc071c5cea39c8335f1c29e6", "ja": "もちろんです♪　アートは、\nディテールを追求することも大事ですからね。", "zh": "那是当然的♪ 毕竟对于艺术而言，\n追求细节也是很重要的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_025roc0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_025roc0294_1013_025roc", "source_sha256": "520cb5038d2182a489821fe4e7e319ce40ecfbfe92b61d4c3c23930c425cd116", "ja": "コスチュームとロコがナイスなペアに見えるように\nこだわってみました！", "zh": "我特意下了一番功夫，让服装和ROCO看起来像一对很棒的搭配！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_025roc0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_025roc0294_1014_p", "source_sha256": "fe2c35237403805596c19354b4ee1dc3bd3fc209eecf7547096b0eed5c4dd8f0", "ja": "ああ、すごくいいと思うよ。\nロコのこだわりポイントは他にもあるのか？", "zh": "啊，我觉得非常棒。\nROCO还有其他特别讲究的地方吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_025roc0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_025roc0294_1015_025roc", "source_sha256": "489bc21a4bb5165dd7baee38836743eb5f319d0e68b3c7750d40b1b9c20051ae", "ja": "ほ、他にですかっ！？\nえっと、えーっと……ああっ、あります！", "zh": "还、还有别的吗！？\n那个，呃——……啊！有的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_025roc0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_025roc0294_1016_025roc", "source_sha256": "66b37e273552417bf3563bcb4fcd31c68a23536189650b7fb51d412f87a9f7a2", "ja": "オーディエンスにチョコを配るんです！\nこのコスチュームにピッタリだと思いませんか？", "zh": "要给观众发巧克力！\n您不觉得这和这套服装很相配吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_025roc0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_025roc0294_1017_025roc", "source_sha256": "c4fa5a4badbb9c37bb08bf2fcc152c719574ef75d04cf3a5867ac03814fee697", "ja": "あと、エントランスにオブジェを置きたいです！\nイメージはまだですけど……ロコに任せてください！", "zh": "还有，我想在入口放个艺术装置！\n虽然具体构想还没定下来……但就交给ROCO吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_025roc0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_025roc0294_1018_p", "source_sha256": "2c2e749ca983b0e8ee581792e7ce8df97204f799d51da54bbd1d2b60a83db860", "ja": "おおっ。劇場全体をチョコナイズするのか。\n……うん、悪くないかもしれないな。", "zh": "哦，要把整个剧场都巧克力化吗？\n……嗯，或许也不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_025roc0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_025roc0294_1019_025roc", "source_sha256": "54c83aad8c8796c116e6036e9908a515ce15c2e07c37e66f1900e2b36f16a501", "ja": "えっ、いいんですか？", "zh": "咦，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_025roc0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_025roc0294_1020", "source_sha256": "197a75c83b9654c76d8cb75f847d2672b0cb33ab7658785d0fb1f4faec462180", "ja": "やってみよう！", "zh": "试着做做看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
